.card.border-0.bg-light
  .card-body
    %h2.h5 Goal of this page
    %p.mb-3
      Anyone can propose apply-ready edits to this Title. People who can update Titles apply or reject submitted proposals.

    %h2.h5 How proposals move
    %ol.mb-0
      %li Draft a proposal from Suggest Edit (or start here).
      %li Edit external title, level, department, summary, and alternative titles.
      %li Submit when ready. Submitted proposals also appear in the MAAP Cleanup Inbox.
      %li An editor applies or rejects (Titles are not versioned).
